Description: High-assurance personal password generator and encrypted vault
 Antigravity Vault is a zero-knowledge personal password generator and
 encrypted vault featuring Argon2id KDF, XChaCha20-Poly1305 encryption,
 memory zeroization, and multi-format portability.
